sequenceDiagram
  participant L as Learner / browser
  participant A as FastAPI validation
  participant P as Personalisation
  participant E as Eligibility / gaps
  participant R as Relevance ranker
  participant K as CSV / local model
  L->>A: Typed profile (synthetic in evaluation)
  A->>P: Validated evidence and preferences
  P->>E: Academic results / completeness / reported awards
  E->>K: Read requirements and source metadata
  E-->>P: Canonical three-state assessments
  P->>R: Candidates with immutable academic groups + preferences
  R->>K: Read descriptors; optional local frozen encoder
  alt Preferences and model available
    R-->>P: Within-group semantic relevance
  else Empty preference / unavailable model
    R-->>P: Explicit unassessed / deterministic fallback
  end
  P-->>A: Academic, relevance, skills and conditional routes separately
  A-->>L: Results, uncertainty, source links and disclaimers
  Note over L,K: Guided assistant reuses engines and does not mutate ranking or eligibility
